<p>Well, I thought that this extremely large creature which is about a minimum of 100&#160;m underground wouldn't be easy to get at to kill. Like, how do they get down there to kill it? It's not going to be coming up to be nuked and it can burrow through the ground pretty quickly even if they do get down there so catching it even if they got underground probably wouldn't be easy.</p>
