<p>Why not &quot;[REDACTED&quot;, which is one word less? Why not blackboxes, which do not even count as words on wordcounter.net? Minor nitpick, but I'm highlighting that.</p>
<blockquote>
<p>Should there be a shortage of D-Class during feeding episodes then civilians are permitted to be used at the discretion of two members of Level 3 personnel.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>While I think you're going for a horror moment, it's not really working for me since there is a certain protocol (depends on headcanon) where civilians can be inducted to D-class status if the need arise (its name escapes me currently). But I feel it will more professional if said protocol is mentioned.</p>
<p>Of course, name-dropping a protocol not everyone knows may not be the best thing. So make of it as you will.</p>
