<p>This SCP's containment procedures feels too Series I in my opinion, and by that I mean exagerated and not neccesary.</p>
<p>Sure, the Foundation is not about destroying the anomalous, but it isn't about just sacrificing humans and complying with the anomalous either. Might be just my headcanon, but I would rather see the Foundation neutralizing this thing and studying its interiors rather than keeping it fed and risking it achieving whatever its trying to.</p>

