<p>With respect to your opinion I disagree. I think that 5 D-Class a month isn't something that the Foundation would give any more thought to than ticking a few boxes.</p>
<p>I also think they wouldn't risk trying to terminate something so big that is causing a relatively negligible amount of harm to the human race in case they pissed it off and made the situation worse. Sure, they ideally would make sure that there isn't a creature snatching a couple of people every month and they'd know exactly what's going on inside of it, but the chance that this could escalate the situation in a bad way is why I don't think the Foundation would try to do that.</p>

